<item><title>Libya agrees visit to assess border surveillance towers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-agrees-visit-to-assess-border-surveillance-towers-47c414/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-agrees-visit-to-assess-border-surveillance-towers-47c414/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The Customs Authority and the European Union mission will inspect sites near Tunisia and discuss repairs, equipment and a proposed joint monitoring centre.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:12:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Libya&apos;s oil corporation sets gas output and flaring goals at Tripoli panels</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-oil-corporation-sets-gas-output-and-flaring-goals-141e98/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-oil-corporation-sets-gas-output-and-flaring-goals-141e98/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>At the Libya Energy 2026 conference (LIBYES 2026), participants discussed raising production to 4 billion cubic feet per day and ending routine flaring by 2030.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:44:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Libya&apos;s investment authority and state oil company sign deal with Oman&apos;s OQ partner</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-investment-authority-and-state-oil-company-sign-4f570e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ly/libya-s-investment-authority-and-state-oil-company-sign-4f570e/</guid><category>Libya</category><description>The agreement, signed in Tripoli, starts preliminary legal steps to explore oil and gas investment opportunities among the three parties.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:20:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" length="30956" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ly.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
